Package: solarispkn-paste
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, b3sum
Description: verified, hardware-aware file copy command-line tool
 SolarisPKN-Paste copies regular files and directories using staged
 writes, digest comparison and conservative HDD/SSD routing.
 .
 This Linux package provides a command-line tool, not the Windows GUI.
 Advanced metadata, POSIX ACL and power-loss guarantees are experimental.
